Subject: [PATCH 13/13] JusBrowse: UI color palettes + matching wallpapers and
 icons

Catppuccin/TokyoNight/Gruvbox/Nord/Dracula/RosePine themes:
WallpapersUseCases entries, FirefoxTheme/ThemeManager overlays,
per-palette launcher icons, accent containers, restart confirmation.
(Status-bar background toggle experiment added then removed; not present.)
